# Line endings are normalized on the way in and restored on the way out, so a checkout on
# Windows gets CRLF and the stored blobs stay LF. Without this the first commit of this tree
# reported forty-two "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings, which is the kind of noise that
# trains people to stop reading warnings.
* text=auto

# Binary, and diffing or normalizing either would corrupt it.
*.png  binary
*.ico  binary
